http://szhorvat.net/ which extends the functionality of IGraph to \
Mathematica.  You only need to load this if you are going to use the \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Find Communities\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] option of \
BigSur.  It is also required for some of the clustering and visualization \
tools used by BigSur\
\>", "Text",
