Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "Identifying parameters that describe underlying gene expression noise (",
 StyleBox["FindTheta",
  FontColor->GrayLevel[0]],
 ")"
}], "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9650303056072493`*^9, 3.9650303281462708`*^9}, {
  3.967416096527151*^9, 3.967416096954946*^9}, {3.984324862747696*^9, 
  3.984324873628829*^9}, {3.998569267413776*^9, 3.998569282797675*^9}, {
  3.998676840519897*^9, 
  3.9986768442432623`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b20022fc-819c-46bf-8ca4-\
5f3d2cefda8e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "To calculate the statistical significance of modified corrected Fano \
factors, and modified corrected Pearson correlation coefficients, BigSur \
needs a model of the underlying gene expression noise.  In BigSur 1.0, the \
model assumed a LogNormal distribution with a constant coefficient of \
variation across all genes.  That constant (\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]c\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]) was learned from the data, under the assumption \
that the majority of the data fit the \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]null hypothesis\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] (i.e. that there are no significant differences \
across cells, and no significant correlations) and that the value of c should \
be the same for all genes.  \n\nStudies using single-molecule fluorescence in \
situ hybridization suggests that, even when cells are relatively uniform, the \
observed coefficient of variation for gene expression is not independent of \
mean gene expression, and an examination of gene expression in scRNAseq \
studies, particularly for lowly expressed genes, supports that trend.   The \
theory of bursty gene expression in fact suggests the following form  c=",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SqrtBox[
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox["1", "\[Mu]"], "+", " ", "\[Theta]"}]]],
  CellChangeTimes->{{3.965029023001381*^9, 3.965029025781538*^9}, 
    3.965029064910729*^9, 3.965029099694047*^9, 3.9650292662525473`*^9, {
    3.965029439805159*^9, 3.9650294405415707`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->
  "376ae376-4e53-4e0e-ae1e-cc4fec9befb2"],
 ", where \[Mu] is mean gene expression and \[Theta] is a parameter.  \n\nIn \
the function ",
 StyleBox["FindTheta",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " we use the data to find an empirical coefficient of variation for each \
gene by finding the value of ",
 StyleBox["c",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " that makes the modified corrected Fano factor for that gene equal 1.  Then \
we fit a smooth curve to those empirical values (or a large enough subset of \
them).  The curve takes either of the form  c=",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SqrtBox[
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox["1", "\[Mu]"], "+", " ", "\[Theta]"}]]],
  CellChangeTimes->{{3.965029023001381*^9, 3.965029025781538*^9}, 
    3.965029064910729*^9, 3.965029099694047*^9, 3.9650292662525473`*^9, {
    3.965029439805159*^9, 3.9650294405415707`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->
  "3b516cd1-3b4a-480f-86c6-db9975e08f6a"],
 " or c=",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SqrtBox[
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox[
     RowBox[{"1", "+", "\[Eta]"}], "\[Mu]"], "+", " ", "\[Theta]"}]]],
  CellChangeTimes->{{3.965029023001381*^9, 3.965029025781538*^9}, 
    3.965029064910729*^9, 3.965029099694047*^9, 3.9650292662525473`*^9, {
    3.965029439805159*^9, 3.9650294405415707`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->
  "63caefd3-0aa6-49a4-956b-363f5db3895b"],
 ", depending on an option chosen by the user.  Theory suggests that the form \
c=",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SqrtBox[
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox["1", "\[Mu]"], "+", " ", "\[Theta]"}]]],
  CellChangeTimes->{{3.965029023001381*^9, 3.965029025781538*^9}, 
    3.965029064910729*^9, 3.965029099694047*^9, 3.9650292662525473`*^9, {
    3.965029439805159*^9, 3.9650294405415707`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->
  "fc998e00-fe5c-40fe-8ef5-9e70eb4b4142"],
 " should be appropriate when the null hypothesis indeed holds--i.e. all \
cells are effectively equivalent, save for the effects of intrinsic gene \
expression noise and sampling error.  In real data, there will commonly be \
cell heterogeneity--not all cells are equivalent--which can vary from very \
small to very large.   The user may want to choose the option where both \
\[Eta] and \[Theta] are fit to the data, using \[Eta] as a measure of cell \
heterogeneity.  However, we recommend that, for using BigSur for either \
feature selection or identifying  gene-gene correlations, leaving \[Eta] set \
to zero is usually best, because it is only \[Theta] that should influence \
the statistics associated with those measurements.  Nonetheless, the code for \
BigSur allows users to include non zero values for \[Eta] is desired.  "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998569321486116*^9, 3.998569366937955*^9}, {
   3.9985694111636*^9, 3.9985697081242867`*^9}, {3.9985697405860786`*^9, 
   3.9985698062997093`*^9}, {3.998569842179798*^9, 3.998569911603035*^9}, 
   3.998571879438665*^9, {3.998571935475209*^9, 3.9985719423716373`*^9}, 
   3.998672392278935*^9, {3.9986743295189*^9, 3.998674509858094*^9}, {
   3.99867461996353*^9, 3.998674712716593*^9}, {3.998674751093679*^9, 
   3.9986753001719103`*^9}, {3.998675331557917*^9, 3.9986754098544683`*^9}, {
   3.99867549080165*^9, 3.998675579529416*^9}, {3.9986756534640007`*^9, 
   3.998675666827627*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b6e22c6e-8233-419c-be2f-\
5550f0e3b13a"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["FindTheta", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998675631924509*^9, 
  3.9986756455916147`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e73aca8c-26e3-429b-adcc-\
8837f748875d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["FindTheta",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " takes a matpac as an argument, and has two options.  If \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]zero eta\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] is set to True (its \
default value), \[Eta] is set to zero and only \[Theta] is returned.  \
Otherwise, \[Eta] is found by two-parameter fitting.  The option \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Sample Goal\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] is set by default \
to 3000, meaning that 3000 randomly chosen genes are used to calculate \
\[Theta].  Experience suggests that this is more than enough to estimate \
\[Theta] accurately, but the user is free to adjust this.  \nIf the number of \
cells is very large, it can take considerable time to calculate the empirical \
coefficients of variation for each gene, as they are calculated by finding \
the value of c that brings the modified corrected Fano factor closest to 1.  \
The code is designed to do these calculations in groups of 200 genes at a \
time, reporting the intermediate results as each group of 200 is added in.  \
This way the user can track how well \[Theta] is converging.  If \[Theta] \
appears to have converged to a close enough value for the user (typically two \
significant digits is plenty), there is a button the user may push at any \
time, labeled \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Stop Operation\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], \
which will terminate the computation.\n\nUltimately the results are returned \
as a graph showing \[Mu] versus 1+\[Eta] +\[Theta]\[Mu], the latter being \
equivalent to 1+ ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox["c", "2"], "\[Mu]"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "792d4718-2e20-4d6b-a742-364b4956a249"],
 " (a measure of the amount by which the Fano factor is expected to exceed 1 \
under the null hypothesis) plotted on top of the empirical coefficients of \
variation also plotted as \[Mu] versus ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"1", "+", 
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["c", "2"], "\[Mu]", " "}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"6d5d51dc-f2e9-43c9-8804-9890f8b3e5f0"],
 " .  ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"1", "+", 
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["c", "2"], "\[Mu]", " "}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"fef69109-836f-435f-a1a0-84ef43eb4226"],
 "  is a useful quantity to plot because it shows how much of an effect ",
 StyleBox["c",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " has on the Fano factor, for different gene expression levels.  As \
expected, when \[Mu] is very low, c has very little effect on the Fano \
factor, because Poisson sampling, rather than gene expression noise, \
dominates the gene expression distribution.  Interestingly, at the very \
highest levels of gene expression (\[Mu]>10) it is common to see some genes\
\[CloseCurlyQuote] empirical coefficients of variation not to be fit very \
well by the values of \[Theta] and \[Eta] that fit more lowely expressed \
genes.  The implication is that, for very highly expressed genes the \
currently accepted noise model may not always be accurate.  \n\nAfter \
displaying the above graph,  FindTheta returns the number of genes tested, \
and, finally, the values of \[Eta] and \[Theta] as a list of replacement \
rules.  \n\nIf one assigns a name to the output of FindTheta, then that name \
will be set to the last output of FindTheta, which is the list of replacement \
rules for \[Eta] and \[Theta].  One can use that name inside BigSur, in the \
slot \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]noiserules\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998675696676259*^9, 3.998675836620453*^9}, {
  3.998675868642523*^9, 3.99867593326858*^9}, {3.9986760862136183`*^9, 
  3.998676163511509*^9}, {3.99867622185421*^9, 3.998676225599537*^9}, {
  3.998676257454835*^9, 3.99867652922618*^9}, {3.9986766039085608`*^9, 
  3.99867665254263*^9}, {3.9986766910590277`*^9, 3.998676754066766*^9}, {
  3.998676787017693*^9, 3.998676813141086*^9}, {3.9986909112939463`*^9, 
  3.998691116412475*^9}, {3.998691188834132*^9, 
  3.998691464188589*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"cfa15f0e-8fc0-4821-bf71-\
ead3447adba9"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Options", "[", "FindTheta", "]"}], "=", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\"\<Sample Goal\>\"", "->", " ", "3000"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<zero eta\>\"", "->", "True"}]}], " ", "}"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"FindTheta", "[", 
   RowBox[{"matpac_", ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"OptionsPattern", "[", "]"}]}], "]"}], ":=", 
  "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
     "mat", ",", "depthlist", ",", "n", ",", "genetotals", ",", " ", "bl", 
      ",", "genesample", ",", "newmat", ",", " ", "newgenetotals", ",", " ", 
      "newematrix", ",", " ", "fittedjvalues", ",", "data", ",", "stop", ",", 
      "indices", ",", "\[Theta]list", ",", "temp", ",", " ", "params", ",", 
      " ", "t1"}], "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"mat", "=", 
      RowBox[{"matpac", "[", 
       RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"If", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<Sample Goal\>\"", "]"}], ">", 
        RowBox[{"Length", "[", "mat", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
        "Print", "[", "\"\<Sample Goal larger than number of genes\>\"", 
         "]"}], ";", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Abort", "[", "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"depthlist", " ", "=", 
      FractionBox[
       RowBox[{"Total", "/@", 
        RowBox[{"N", "[", 
         RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", "mat", "]"}], "]"}]}], 
       RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
        RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", "mat", "]"}], "]"}]]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"genetotals", "=", 
      RowBox[{"Total", "/@", "mat"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"n", "=", 
      RowBox[{"Width", "[", "mat", "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"bl", "=", 
      RowBox[{"BinLists", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Log", "@", "genetotals"}], "->", 
         RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Length", "[", "genetotals", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
        "0.5"}], " ", "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"genesample", "=", 
      RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"RandomSample", "[", 
          RowBox[{"#", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Min", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Length", "[", "#", "]"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"Ceiling", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<Sample Goal\>\"", "]"}], "/", 
               RowBox[{"Length", "[", "bl", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], 
         "&"}], "/@", "bl"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"newmat", "=", 
      RowBox[{"mat", "[", 
       RowBox[{"[", "genesample", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"newgenetotals", "=", 
      RowBox[{"genetotals", "[", 
       RowBox[{"[", "genesample", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"indices", "=", 
      RowBox[{"Partition", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"RandomSample", "[", 
         RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Length", "[", "newgenetotals", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
        " ", 
        RowBox[{"UpTo", "[", "200", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"newematrix", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", "[", 
       RowBox[{"newgenetotals", ",", " ", "depthlist"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"fittedjvalues", "=", 
      RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ";", 
     RowBox[{"\[Theta]list", "=", 
      RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ";", 
     RowBox[{"data", "=", 
      RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"For", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"k", "=", "1"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"k", "<=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Length", "[", "indices", "]"}]}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"k", "++"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"fittedjvalues", "=", 
         RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
          RowBox[{"fittedjvalues", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"j", "/.", 
              RowBox[{"FindRoot", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"Total", "@", 
                  RowBox[{"(", 
                   FractionBox[
                    SuperscriptBox[
                    RowBox[{"(", 
                    RowBox[{
                    FractionBox[
                    RowBox[{"newmat", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "i", "]"}], "]"}], 
                    RowBox[{"newematrix", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "i", "]"}], "]"}]], "-", "1"}], ")"}], "2"], 
                    RowBox[{"(", 
                    RowBox[{
                    FractionBox["1", 
                    RowBox[{"newematrix", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "i", "]"}], "]"}]], "+", "j"}], " ", ")"}]], 
                   ")"}]}], " ", "+", "1", "-", "n"}], ",", " ", 
                RowBox[{"{", 
                 RowBox[{"j", ",", "1"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
                RowBox[{"Method", "->", " ", "\"\<Secant\>\""}]}], "]"}]}], 
             ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", 
               RowBox[{"indices", "[", 
                RowBox[{"[", "k", "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
        ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"data", "=", 
         RowBox[{"N", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{
               FractionBox[
                RowBox[{"newgenetotals", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"[", 
                  RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
                   RowBox[{"indices", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"1", ";;", "k"}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], 
                 "]"}], "n"], ",", " ", 
               RowBox[{"1", "+", 
                RowBox[{"fittedjvalues", "*", 
                 FractionBox[
                  RowBox[{"newgenetotals", "[", 
                   RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"indices", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"1", ";;", "k"}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], 
                   "]"}], "n"]}]}]}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"Last", "[", "#", "]"}], ">", "0"}], "&"}]}], "]"}], 
          "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"If", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<zero eta\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
          "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
          RowBox[{"params", "=", 
           RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"\[Eta]", "->", "0"}], "}"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"FindFit", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"Log", "[", "data", "]"}], ",", " ", 
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"Log", "[", 
                  RowBox[{"1", "+", " ", 
                   RowBox[{"\[Theta]", "*", 
                    SuperscriptBox["E", "x"]}]}], "]"}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"\[Theta]", ">", "0"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{"{", 
                 RowBox[{"\[Theta]", ",", "0.1"}], "}"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
               "x", ",", 
               RowBox[{"NormFunction", "->", 
                RowBox[{"{", 
                 RowBox[{"\"\<HuberPenalty\>\"", ",", "0.01"}], "}"}]}]}], 
              "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
          RowBox[{"params", "=", 
           RowBox[{"FindFit", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Log", "[", "data", "]"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"Log", "[", 
                RowBox[{"1", "+", " ", "\[Eta]", " ", "+", " ", 
                 RowBox[{"\[Theta]", "*", 
                  SuperscriptBox["E", "x"]}]}], "]"}], ",", 
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"\[Eta]", ">", "0"}], ",", " ", 
                 RowBox[{"\[Theta]", ">", "0"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", "  ", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{"\[Eta]", ",", "0"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{"\[Theta]", ",", "0.1"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
             "x", ",", 
             RowBox[{"NormFunction", "->", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{"\"\<HuberPenalty\>\"", ",", "0.01"}], "}"}]}]}], 
            "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"AppendTo", "[", 
         RowBox[{"\[Theta]list", ",", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"k", ",", 
            RowBox[{"\[Theta]", "/.", "params"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"NotebookDelete", "[", "t1", "]"}], ";", 
        RowBox[{"NotebookDelete", "[", "stop", "]"}], ";", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"t1", "=", 
         RowBox[{"PrintTemporary", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Last", "/@", "\[Theta]list"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"NotebookDelete", "[", "temp", "]"}], ";", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"temp", "=", 
         RowBox[{"PrintTemporary", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Grid", "[", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"{", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"ListPlot", "[", 
               RowBox[{"\[Theta]list", ",", " ", 
                RowBox[{"Joined", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
                RowBox[{"PlotRange", "->", " ", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"1", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"Length", "[", "indices", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"0", ",", "Automatic"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}]}], 
               "]"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
              RowBox[{"Show", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"ListLogLogPlot", "[", "data", "]"}], ",", 
                RowBox[{"LogLogPlot", "[", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"(", 
                    RowBox[{"1", "+", "\[Eta]", "+", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"\[Theta]", "*", "\[Mu]"}]}], ")"}], "/.", 
                   "params"}], ",", " ", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"\[Mu]", ",", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"Min", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"First", "/@", "data"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"First", "/@", "data"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
                  RowBox[{"PlotRange", "->", " ", "All"}], ",", "  ", 
                  RowBox[{"PlotStyle", "->", " ", "Red"}], ",", " ", 
                  RowBox[{"Frame", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
                  RowBox[{"FrameLabel", "->", " ", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"\<mean expression (\[Mu])\>\"", ",", " ", 
                    "\"\<1+\[Eta]+\[Theta]\[Mu]\>\""}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}]}], 
               "]"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "}"}], "}"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], 
        ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"stop", "=", 
         RowBox[{"PrintTemporary", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Button", "[", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<Stop Operation\>\"", ",", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
              RowBox[{"Show", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"ListLogLogPlot", "[", "data", "]"}], ",", 
                RowBox[{"LogLogPlot", "[", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{"(", 
                    RowBox[{"1", "+", "\[Eta]", "+", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"\[Theta]", "*", "\[Mu]"}]}], ")"}], "/.", 
                   "params"}], ",", " ", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"\[Mu]", ",", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"Min", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"First", "/@", "data"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"First", "/@", "data"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
                  RowBox[{"PlotRange", "->", " ", "All"}], ",", "  ", 
                  RowBox[{"PlotStyle", "->", " ", "Red"}], ",", " ", 
                  RowBox[{"Frame", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
                  RowBox[{"FrameLabel", "->", " ", 
                   RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"\<mean expression (\[Mu])\>\"", ",", " ", 
                    "\"\<1+\[Eta]+\[Theta]\[Mu]\>\""}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}]}], 
               "]"}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
             RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"200", "k", " ", "\"\<genes tested\>\""}], ",", " ", 
                "params"}], "}"}], "]"}], ";", 
             RowBox[{
             "FrontEndTokenExecute", "[", "\"\<EvaluatorAbort\>\"", "]"}]}]}],
            "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"NotebookDelete", "[", "stop", "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
      RowBox[{"Show", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"ListLogLogPlot", "[", "data", "]"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"LogLogPlot", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"1", "+", "\[Eta]", "+", " ", 
             RowBox[{"\[Theta]", "*", "\[Mu]"}]}], ")"}], "/.", "params"}], 
          ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"\[Mu]", ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"Min", "[", 
             RowBox[{"First", "/@", "data"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
             RowBox[{"First", "/@", "data"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"PlotRange", "->", " ", "All"}], ",", "  ", 
          RowBox[{"PlotStyle", "->", " ", "Red"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Frame", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"FrameLabel", "->", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
            "\"\<mean expression (\[Mu])\>\"", ",", " ", 
             "\"\<1+\[Eta]+\[Theta]\[Mu]\>\""}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], 
      "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"200", "k", " ", "\"\<genes tested\>\""}], ",", " ", 
       "params"}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}]}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.965029474711892*^9, 3.965029724114294*^9}, {
   3.965029767588723*^9, 3.965029811128416*^9}, {3.965029861062038*^9, 
   3.965029908779766*^9}, {3.9650299759592876`*^9, 3.965030001056531*^9}, {
   3.9650300323910427`*^9, 3.965030050047575*^9}, {3.965030080886397*^9, 
   3.9650300952946444`*^9}, {3.965030150280223*^9, 3.9650301782466087`*^9}, {
   3.9650311664045477`*^9, 3.965031273549402*^9}, {3.96503232619238*^9, 
   3.965032345438122*^9}, {3.965953557306192*^9, 3.965953557651108*^9}, {
   3.9659535968277893`*^9, 3.965953642718355*^9}, {3.965953676218206*^9, 
   3.9659536903026447`*^9}, {3.965953720428129*^9, 3.965953731261801*^9}, {
   3.9659538244123287`*^9, 3.9659538690614758`*^9}, {3.965953961693536*^9, 
   3.965953963331542*^9}, {3.965954066482671*^9, 3.965954079622851*^9}, 
   3.9659541529062862`*^9, {3.965954270152226*^9, 3.965954384636273*^9}, {
   3.965954625408709*^9, 3.965954640970409*^9}, {3.965954777471698*^9, 
