    3.967832023192741*^9, 3.9678320597077007`*^9}, {3.9678320902514963`*^9, 
    3.9678320975338087`*^9}, {3.967904182810204*^9, 3.967904242290628*^9}, {
    3.9679083672546797`*^9, 3.967908434060556*^9}, {3.967908499163864*^9, 
    3.967908501343054*^9}, {3.9679085667873507`*^9, 3.967908569101068*^9}, {
    3.967908626957196*^9, 3.9679086294068737`*^9}, {3.967908759032401*^9, 
    3.9679087736060543`*^9}, {3.9679090013815928`*^9, 3.967909006695292*^9}, {
    3.967909039522531*^9, 3.967909043459186*^9}, {3.96790913365495*^9, 
    3.967909145533299*^9}, {3.971873286307962*^9, 3.971873301795429*^9}, {
    3.971873346836566*^9, 3.971873348017638*^9}, {3.979985532072877*^9, 
    3.979985535086225*^9}, {3.980016756943943*^9, 3.98001675890452*^9}, {
    3.980016816228706*^9, 3.9800168185685263`*^9}, {3.980234828952331*^9, 
    3.980234880446824*^9}, {3.980235183401256*^9, 3.980235184623218*^9}, {
    3.980414990857095*^9, 3.980415030206102*^9}, {3.9804200218013983`*^9, 
    3.9804200312305317`*^9}, {3.983307840163073*^9, 3.9833078405384502`*^9}, 
    3.983547391917344*^9, {3.996511657779767*^9, 3.9965116902915773`*^9}, {
    3.9986775029391317`*^9, 3.998677541244698*^9}, {3.998677576355522*^9, 
    3.9986776270681953`*^9}, {3.998677663247315*^9, 3.998677743445387*^9}, {
    3.9986777788930387`*^9, 3.998677788158957*^9}, {3.9986778622313747`*^9, 
    3.998677982282011*^9}, {3.998678028987121*^9, 3.998678180926628*^9}},
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"7cc45afb-aa9d-4120-8578-4aded6e88c7a"],
 StyleBox[", where \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]mat\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] is the \
counts matrix with all the genes and cells.  \n\
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Correlations\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]:   Default = \
False.  When set to",
  Background->None],
 " False, only the Fano factors and their statistics are calculated.  When \
set to True both Fano factors and correlation coefficients are done.  \n\
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]alpha\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]  Default: 0.02.  The FDR \
cutoff you wish to use\n\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Pvalue\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
 Default: \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]BH\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote].  \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]BH\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] means use the Benjamini \
Hochberg procedure to control the FDR.  Alternatively one may enter an \
arbitrary Pvalue cutoff.  If you enter any other text it will use a \
Bonferroni cutoff\n\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]First Pass Cutoff\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]:  To avoid wasting time calculating p-values when \
one knows in advance they are going to be too large to matter, there is a \
default cutoff that gets passed to the function that finds the roots of the \
Cornish Fisher Polynomials, causing it to skip over cases where the roots can \
be judged quickly to correspond to such p-values.  The default is 2, meaning \
a pvalue of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["10", 
    RowBox[{"-", "2"}]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "df81cc69-a690-4df8-8d69-17914d7929a3"],
 ".  \n\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Fano Inverse Sqrt Moments\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]-> For each gene pair, the moments calculated to \
produce the Cornish Fisher Polynomials need to get corrected for the \
multiplication of the inverse of the geometric mean of the modified corrected \
 fano factors that occurs in generating PCC\[CloseCurlyQuote].  That\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]s a rather slow process, and the corrections tend to be \
very small for most genes.  Setting this option to False will suppress that \
step; some errors will be generated but the code will take less time to run.  \
Not a bad idea if one wants to just take a quick look see at how the results \
may come out.  \n\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Find Communities\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]  The code can either end by returning an adjacency \
matrix, or it can continue on and use the Walktrap Algorithm to find gene \
communities, which is the default.  If you don\[CloseCurlyQuote]t want it to \
do that last step, set this to False.  Finding communities by walktrap isn\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]t usually particularly time consuming, but if the number of \
significant correlations is very large it can be.  A very large number of \
significant correlations is usually a sign of a great deal of cell \
heterogeneity, and in that situation one might not want to bother finding \
communities"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998676951308344*^9, 3.998677039608932*^9}, {
  3.998677103824929*^9, 3.998677461815515*^9}, {3.998691483262856*^9, 
  3.998691697260707*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5cc30cd9-e823-4ac8-afca-\
0b1ccf2434f0"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Options", "[", "BigSur2", "]"}], "=", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"\"\<Depthscaling\>\"", "->", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<Correlations\>\"", "->", " ", "False"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<alpha\>\"", "->", " ", "0.02"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<Pvalue\>\"", "->", " ", "\"\<BH\>\""}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<First Pass Cutoff\>\"", "->", " ", "2"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<Fano Inverse Sqrt Moments\>\"", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", 
      " ", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<Find Communities\>\"", "->", " ", "True"}]}], "}"}]}], 
   ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"BigSur2", "[", 
    RowBox[{"matpac_", ",", "noiserules_", ",", "filemarker_", ",", 
     RowBox[{"OptionsPattern", "[", "]"}]}], "]"}], ":=", " ", 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
      "foldername", ",", "n", ",", "m", ",", "\[Eta]", ",", " ", "\[Theta]", 
       ",", " ", "z", ",", "clist", ",", " ", "negccthreshold", ",", " ", 
       "mat", ",", " ", "depthlist", ",", " ", "genetotals", ",", " ", 
       "ematrix", ",", " ", "pmatrix", ",", " ", "mflist", ",", 
       "fanocorrectionmatrices", ",", " ", "pccmatrix", ",", "\[Kappa]lists", 
       ",", "ccmats", ",", "polylist", ",", " ", "polymatrix", ",", 
       "equationslist", ",", "logplist", ",", "pccSignmatrix", ",", 
       "augmentedParameters", ",", "xlist", ",", "equivalentPCCs", ",", 
       "logpmatrix", ",", " ", "rows", ",", "randomematrix", ",", "randommat",
        ",", "randompmatrix", ",", " ", "randommflist", ",", 
       "randomfanocorrectionmatrices", ",", "invsqrtmoments", ",", 
       "randompolymatrix", ",", "randompccmatrix", ",", "randomccmats", ",", 
       "randompccSignmatrix", ",", "randomaugmentedParameters", ",", 
       "randomxlist", ",", "randomlogpmatrix", ",", "cutoff", ",", " ", 
       "bhcutoff", ",", " ", "bonferroni", ",", "sigcutofflevel", ",", 
       "sigcutofflist", ",", "truesigdata", ",", "randomsigdata", ",", 
       "significantPCCmatrix", ",", "gno", ",", " ", "subsetgno", ",", 
       "communities"}], "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"mat", "=", 
       RowBox[{"matpac", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"genetotals", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Total", "/@", "mat"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"n", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Width", "[", "mat", "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"m", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Length", "[", "genetotals", "]"}]}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"\[Eta]", "=", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Values", "[", "noiserules", "]"}], "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"\[Theta]", "=", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Values", "[", "noiserules", "]"}], "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"If", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Min", "[", "genetotals", "]"}], " ", "\[Equal]", "0"}], ",",
         " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Print", "[", "\"\<Some genes have no counts\>\"", "]"}], 
         ";", 
         RowBox[{"Abort", "[", "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"If", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Count", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Tally", "[", 
            RowBox[{"matpac", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"x_", ",", "y_"}], "}"}], "/;", 
            RowBox[{"y", ">", "1"}]}]}], "]"}], ">", "0"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
         "Print", "[", "\"\<Matpac contains duplicated genes\>\"", "]"}], ";",
          " ", 
         RowBox[{"Abort", "[", "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"If", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"ListQ", "[", 
          RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<Depthscaling\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], "==",
          "False"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
         "Print", "[", "\"\<Depthscaling list has wrong format\>\"", "]"}], 
         ";", 
         RowBox[{"Abort", "[", "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"If", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Length", "[", 
           RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<Depthscaling\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], 
          ">", "0"}], "&&", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Length", "[", 
           RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<Depthscaling\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], "!=",
           " ", "n"}]}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
         "Print", "[", "\"\<Depthscaling list has wrong length\>\"", "]"}], 
         ";", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Abort", "[", "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"clist", "=", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         SqrtBox[
          RowBox[{
           FractionBox["\[Eta]", "#"], "+", " ", "\[Theta]"}]], "&"}], "/@", 
        RowBox[{"N", "[", 
         FractionBox["genetotals", "n"], "]"}]}]}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"SetDirectory", "[", 
       RowBox[{"NotebookDirectory", "[", "]"}], "]"}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<Started on\>\"", ",", 
        RowBox[{"CurrentDate", "[", "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"foldername", "=", 
       RowBox[{"filemarker", "<>", 
        RowBox[{"DateString", "[", "]"}], "<>", "\"\< \[Eta]=\>\"", "<>", 
        RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
         RowBox[{"Round", "[", 
          RowBox[{"\[Eta]", ",", "0.001"}], "]"}], "]"}], "<>", 
        "\"\< \[Theta]=\>\"", "<>", 
        RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
         RowBox[{"Round", "[", 
          RowBox[{"\[Theta]", ",", "0.001"}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"CreateDirectory", "[", "foldername", "]"}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"SetDirectory", "[", "foldername", "]"}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"Print", "[", "\"\<Folder name is\>\"", "]"}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"Print", "[", "foldername", "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"Export", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"filemarker", "<>", "\"\<_matpac metadata.mx\>\""}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"matpac", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "4", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"depthlist", "=", 
       RowBox[{"If", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<Depthscaling\>\"", "]"}], "==", 
          RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{"Total", "/@", 
           RowBox[{"N", "[", 
            RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", "mat", "]"}], "]"}]}], 
          RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", "mat", "]"}], "]"}]], ",", 
         RowBox[{"N", "[", 
          RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<Depthscaling\>\"", "]"}], "]"}]}], 
        "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"ematrix", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", "[", 
        RowBox[{"genetotals", ",", " ", "depthlist"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"pmatrix", " ", "=", 
       FractionBox[
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"mat", "-", "ematrix"}], ")"}], 
        SqrtBox[
         RowBox[{"ematrix", 
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"1", "+", 
            RowBox[{
             SuperscriptBox["clist", "2"], "ematrix"}]}], ")"}]}]]]}], "  ", 
      ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"Export", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"filemarker", "<>", "\"\<_cell-specific residuals.mx\>\""}], 
        ",", " ", "pmatrix"}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"mflist", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        FractionBox["1", 
         RowBox[{"n", "-", "1"}]], 
        RowBox[{"Total", "/@", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          SuperscriptBox["pmatrix", "2"], ")"}]}]}]}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"Export", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
        "filemarker", "<>", "\"\<_modified_corrected_Fano factors.mx\>\""}], 
        ",", " ", "mflist"}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
       RowBox[{
       "\"\<Modified, corrected Fano factors acquired and saved\>\"", ",", 
        " ", 
        RowBox[{"TimeObject", "[", "Now", "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"\[Kappa]lists", "=", 
       RowBox[{"If", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"n", "<=", "1000"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"FanoCumulantsNB5CF", "[", 
          RowBox[{"ematrix", ",", "clist", ",", "n"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"FanoCumulantsNB5alt", "[", 
          RowBox[{"ematrix", ",", "clist", ",", "n"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"polylist", "=", 
       RowBox[{"CornishFisherPolynomialCoefficientsforFano5CFAlt", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\[Kappa]lists", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\[Kappa]lists", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\[Kappa]lists", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"\[Kappa]lists", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "4", "]"}], "]"}], ",", "mflist", ",", "n"}], "]"}]}], 
      ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"equationslist", " ", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Dot", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           SuperscriptBox["x", "k"], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"k", ",", "0", ",", " ", "4"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
         "polylist"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"logplist", "=", 
       RowBox[{"FixedPosPValFunc", "/@", 
        RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
            RowBox[{"0", ",", "#"}], "]"}], "&"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"Min", "/@", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"(", 
                RowBox[{"x", "/.", 
                 RowBox[{"FindInstance", "[", 
                  RowBox[{
                   RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"#", "==", "0"}], "&&", 
                    RowBox[{"x", ">", "0"}]}], ",", "x", ",", "Reals", ",", 
                   "2"}], "]"}]}], ")"}], "/.", 
               RowBox[{"x", "->", 
                RowBox[{"{", "0", "}"}]}]}], "&"}], "/@", "equationslist"}], 
            ")"}]}]}], "]"}]}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"Export", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"filemarker", "<>", "\"\<_fanopvalues.mx\>\""}], ",", " ", 
        "logplist"}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<Fano p-values acquired and saved\>\"", ",", 
        RowBox[{"TimeObject", "[", "Now", "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"If", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", " ", "\"\<Correlations\>\"", "]"}], "==",
          " ", "False"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Goto", "[", "end", "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"pccmatrix", "=", 
       RowBox[{"DotProductCF", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Evaluate", "[", 
          FractionBox["pmatrix", 
           SqrtBox[
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"(", 
              RowBox[{"n", "-", "1"}], ")"}], "mflist"}]]], "]"}], ",", "n"}],
         "]"}]}], " ", ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"Export", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"filemarker", "<>", "\"\<_pccmatrix.mx\>\""}], ",", " ", 
        "pccmatrix"}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
       RowBox[{
       "\"\<Modified corrected correlations acquired and saved \>\"", ",", 
        RowBox[{"TimeObject", "[", "Now", "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"pccSignmatrix", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
        RowBox[{"LowerTriangularize", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"BoolEval", "[", 
            RowBox[{"pccmatrix", ">", "0"}], "]"}], "-", 
           RowBox[{"BoolEval", "[", 
            RowBox[{"pccmatrix", "<=", "0"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"-", "1"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"If", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
         "OptionValue", "[", "\"\<Fano Inverse Sqrt Moments\>\"", "]"}], "==",
          "True"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"invsqrtmoments", "=", 
          RowBox[{"InverseSqrtFanoMomentsListNB", "[", 
           RowBox[{
           "genetotals", ",", "depthlist", ",", " ", "\[Eta]", ",", " ", 
            "\[Theta]", ",", " ", "n"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
         RowBox[{"Export", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"filemarker", "<>", "\"\<_invsqrtmoments.mx\>\""}], ",", 
           " ", "invsqrtmoments"}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
         RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
          RowBox[{
          "\"\<inverse squareroot Fano moments acquired and saved \>\"", ",", 
           RowBox[{"TimeObject", "[", "Now", "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
         "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
         RowBox[{"fanocorrectionmatrices", "=", 
          RowBox[{"SqrtCorrectionmats", "[", 
           RowBox[{"invsqrtmoments", ",", "genetotals"}], "]"}]}]}], ",", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"fanocorrectionmatrices", "=", 
          RowBox[{"Table", "[", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"ConstantArray", "[", 
             RowBox[{"1", ",", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{"m", ",", "m"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", "4"}], "]"}]}], 
         ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
         RowBox[{
         "Print", "[", "\"\<inverse squareroot Fano moments ignored \>\"", 
          "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"ccmats", "=", 
       RowBox[{"CorrelationCumulantsNB", "[", 
        RowBox[{"ematrix", ",", 
         RowBox[{"fanocorrectionmatrices", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"fanocorrectionmatrices", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"fanocorrectionmatrices", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"fanocorrectionmatrices", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "4", "]"}], "]"}], ",", "clist", ",", "n"}], "]"}]}], 
      ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<Adjusted cumulants of the correlations acquired\>\"", ",", 
        RowBox[{"TimeObject", "[", "Now", "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"polymatrix", "=", 
       RowBox[{"CornishFisherPolynomialCoefficients5CF", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"ccmats", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"ccmats", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"ccmats", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"ccmats", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "4", "]"}], "]"}], " ", ",", "pccmatrix"}], "]"}]}], 
      " ", ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<Cornish Fisher Polynomial Coefficients acquired\>\"", ",", 
        RowBox[{"TimeObject", "[", "Now", "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"augmentedParameters", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
        RowBox[{"SymmetricMatrixToListNew", "/@", 
         RowBox[{"Append", "[", 
          RowBox[{"polymatrix", ",", " ", "pccSignmatrix"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}],
       ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Length", "[", "augmentedParameters", "]"}], "]"}], "<>", 
         "\"\< equations gathered\>\""}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"TimeObject", "[", "Now", "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"xlist", "=", 
       RowBox[{"ImprovedFindXAlt", "[", 
        RowBox[{"augmentedParameters", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<First Pass Cutoff\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
         " ", "genetotals", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<alpha\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
      " ", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"Export", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"filemarker", "<>", "\"\<_xlist.mx\>\""}], ",", "xlist"}], 
       "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<x-values acquired\>\"", ",", 
        RowBox[{"TimeObject", "[", "Now", "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"logpmatrix", "=", 
       RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Thread", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"IntegerPart", "[", 
            RowBox[{"MatrixIndexCF", "/@", 
             RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
              RowBox[{"xlist", "[", "\"\<ExplicitPositions\>\"", "]"}], 
              "]"}]}], "]"}], "->", " ", 
           RowBox[{"FixedPValFunc", "/@", 
            RowBox[{"xlist", "[", "\"\<ExplicitValues\>\"", "]"}]}]}], "]"}], 
         ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"m", ",", " ", "m"}], "}"}], ",", " ", "0"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"Export", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"filemarker", "<>", "\"\<_logpvalues.mx\>\""}], ",", 
        "logpmatrix"}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<p-values acquired and saved\>\"", ",", 
        RowBox[{"TimeObject", "[", "Now", "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"equivalentPCCs", " ", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Quiet", "[", 
        RowBox[{"InferredPCCs2", "[", 
         RowBox[{"logpmatrix", ",", "pccSignmatrix", ",", 
          RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<First Pass Cutoff\>\"", "]"}], ",",
           " ", "n"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"Export", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"filemarker", "<>", "\"\<_equivalentPCCs.mx\>\""}], ",", " ", 
        "equivalentPCCs"}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<equivalent PCCs acquired and saved\>\"", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"TimeObject", "[", "Now", "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"Which", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"NumberQ", "[", 
         RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<Pvalue\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"sigcutofflist", " ", "=", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<Pvalue\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"2", "*", 
            RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<Pvalue\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"3", "*", 
            RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<Pvalue\>\"", "]"}]}]}], "}"}]}], 
        ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<Pvalue\>\"", "]"}], "==", 
         "\"\<BH\>\""}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"sigcutofflist", " ", "=", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"#", ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"2", "#"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"3", "#"}]}], "}"}], "&"}], "@", 
          RowBox[{"BHNew", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"10", "^", 
             RowBox[{"-", 
              RowBox[{"(", 
               RowBox[{"logpmatrix", "[", "\"\<ExplicitValues\>\"", "]"}], 
               ")"}]}]}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<alpha\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"Binomial", "[", 
             RowBox[{"m", ",", "2"}], "]"}]}], " ", "]"}]}]}], ",", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", "True", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"sigcutofflist", " ", "=", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"N", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<alpha\>\"", "]"}], "/", 
             RowBox[{"Binomial", "[", 
              RowBox[{"m", ",", "2"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"2", "*", 
            RowBox[{"N", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<alpha\>\"", "]"}], "/", 
              RowBox[{"Binomial", "[", 
               RowBox[{"m", ",", "2"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"3", "*", 
            RowBox[{"N", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<alpha\>\"", "]"}], "/", 
              RowBox[{"Binomial", "[", 
               RowBox[{"m", ",", "2"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}], 
      ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"\"\<For FDR = \>\"", "<>", 
         RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
          RowBox[{"OptionValue", "[", "\"\<alpha\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], "<>", 
         "\"\<, the significance level is p < \>\""}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"ScientificForm", "[", 
         RowBox[{"sigcutofflist", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"significantPCCmatrix", "=", 
       RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"BoolEval", "[", 
           RowBox[{"logpmatrix", ">", 
            RowBox[{"-", 
             RowBox[{"Log10", "[", 
              RowBox[{"sigcutofflist", "[", 
               RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}], "*", 
